"""agent-voice (v4.0.0)
Agent Auditory Interface & CosyVoice 3.0 MLX Multi-Voice and Instructive Style Manager.

Key Capabilities:
  - Backward-compatible speech synthesis: agent-voice "<text>"
  - Explicit voice profile: agent-voice --voice <id> "<text>"
  - Explicit delivery style: agent-voice --style <id> "<text>"
  - Raw expert instruction: agent-voice --instruct "<prompt>" "<text>"
  - Voice × Style orthogonal routing: agent-voice --event <event> "<text>"
  - Playback speed & gain control: agent-voice --speed 1.05 --gain 1 "<text>"
  - Dry run resolution: agent-voice --dry-run --style warm "<text>"
  - Voice registry: agent-voice voices, agent-voice voice show/validate/normalize <id>
  - Style registry: agent-voice styles, agent-voice style show <id>
  - Runtime diagnostic probe: agent-voice doctor
  - Style benchmark harness: agent-voice benchmark
  - Audition suite: agent-voice audition <id|--all> [--style <id>]
  - Asset & config migration: agent-voice migrate [--to 4]
  - Kernel flock concurrency, pass_fds lock inheritance, and zero resident RAM.
"""
